 is an issue with the"},{"t":347,"txt":"transmitter let's say a broken cable the"},{"t":350.7,"txt":"input card will detect this as an out of"},{"t":353.3,"txt":"range condition that will alert an"},{"t":355.2,"txt":"operator there is a problem this would"},{"t":357.5,"txt":"not happen if zero bar was represented"},{"t":360,"txt":"by zero milliamps so we now have a basic"},{"t":363.7,"txt":"understanding of what transmitters do"},{"t":365.7,"txt":"and the role they play in control"},{"t":367.3,"txt":"systems in future videos we're going to"},{"t":369.8,"txt":"look at specific transmitter types and"},{"t":371.7,"txt":"talk about the principles of their"},{"t":372.9,"txt":"operation if you'd like to see these"},{"t":375.4,"txt":"videos and more on instrumentation then"},{"t":377.9,"txt":"please subscribe and hit the bell icon"},{"t":379.4,"txt":"for notifications of new videos thank"},{"t":382.3,"txt":"you and see you next time"}],"words":[{"t":0.199,"w":"hello"},{"t":1.199,"w":"welcome"},{"t":1.709,"w":"back"},{"t":1.86,"w":"to"},{"t":2.01,"w":"another"},{"t":2.37,"w":"lesson"},{"t":2.639,"w":"on"},{"t":2.97,"w":"instrumentation"},{"t":3.72,"w":"control"},{"t":4.04,"w":"in"},{"t":5.04,"w":"our"},{"t":5.19,"w":"previous"},{"t":5.43,"w":"video"},{"t":5.819,"w":"see"},{"t":6.45,"w":"the"},{"t":6.569,"w":"link"},{"t":6.72,"w":"in"},{"t":6.839,"w":"the"},{"t":6.93,"w":"description"},{"t":7.35,"w":"below"},{"t":7.47,"w":"we"},{"t":8.28,"w":"introduce"},{"t":8.61,"w":"you"},{"t":8.82,"w":"to"},{"t":8.849,"w":"process"},{"t":9.389,"w":"control"},{"t":9.809,"w":"loops"},{"t":10.05,"w":"and"},{"t":10.32,"w":"how"},{"t":10.53,"w":"they're"},{"t":10.71,"w":"used"},{"t":10.98,"w":"in"},{"t":11.07,"w":"a"},{"t":11.16,"w":"home"},{"t":11.309,"w":"heating"},{"t":11.55,"w":"system"},{"t":12.03,"w":"today"},{"t":13.019,"w":"we're"},{"t":13.5,"w":"going"},{"t":13.62,"w":"to"},{"t":13.769,"w":"expand"},{"t":14.13,"w":"on"},{"t":14.25,"w":"this"},{"t":14.4,"w":"and"},{"t":15.059,"w":"tal